-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  dir_subsystem_err_linux.pcpp - Directive: @subsystem gui on Linux

  Break step of dir_subsystem: gui on a target that is not Windows is a
  warning (the setting is not used, the build goes on). Linux only: on
  Windows gui applies.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe dir_subsystem_err_linux;

/*
  @@test
    kind build
    targets x86_64-linux-gnu
  @@end
*/

@subsystem gui; // WARN SM0103@1: a target that is not Windows

begin
end.
